<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>1. Our promise</h2>
  <p>
    At Sanoozy, we want you to enjoy every order. This Refund Policy explains when a return, replacement, or refund may
    be available. Because we sell food and drink products, some items cannot be returned once they have been opened or
    consumed, except where there is a quality or fulfillment issue.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>2. When a refund or replacement may apply</h2>
  <p>You may request a refund or replacement if:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>You received the wrong product or the wrong quantity</li>
    <li>The product arrived damaged, leaking, or defective</li>
    <li>The product is expired or not in sellable condition on arrival</li>
    <li>An item is missing from your delivered order</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Please contact us within 48 hours of delivery and share your order number plus clear photos of the product and packaging.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>3. What is not eligible</h2>
  <p>Refunds or returns are generally not available for:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>A change of mind after the order has been shipped</li>
    <li>Opened, used, or consumed products with no quality issue</li>
    <li>Products stored or handled incorrectly after delivery</li>
    <li>Orders cancelled after dispatch — see our <a href="{{ pages['cancel-order'].url | default: '/pages/cancel-order' }}">Cancel Order</a> page</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>4. How to request a refund</h2>
  <p>To start a refund or replacement request, contact us by WhatsApp or email and include:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your order number</li>
    <li>Your full name and contact number</li>
    <li>A short description of the issue</li>
    <li>Photos or a short video of the product and parcel, where relevant</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    WhatsApp / Phone: <a href="https://wa.me/923148232224" target="_blank" rel="noopener">0314 8232224</a><br>
    Email: <a href="mailto:contact.sanoozy@gmail.com">contact.sanoozy@gmail.com</a>
  </p>
</section>

<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>5. How refunds are issued</h2>
  <p>
    Once your request is approved, we will offer a replacement or a refund, depending on stock and the nature of the
    issue. Approved refunds are typically processed within 7–10 business days to the original payment method, or as
    store credit if that was agreed with you. Cash-on-delivery refunds may be issued through bank transfer or another
    method confirmed by our team.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>6. Shipping for returns</h2>
  <p>
    If the return is due to our error or a defective product, Sanoozy will cover the return shipping cost. If a return
    is not approved, any collected parcel may be sent back to you and shipping charges may apply.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>7. Cancellations</h2>
  <p>
    Orders can only be cancelled before they are shipped. After dispatch, please refer to this Refund Policy. For
    cancellation steps, visit our
    <a href="{{ pages['cancel-order'].url | default: '/pages/cancel-order' }}">Cancel Order</a> page.
  </p>
</section>
